sequenceDiagram
    actor Merchant as 商家管理员
    participant UI as MerchantOrders
    participant API as frontend/src/api.ts
    participant Sec as SecurityConfig
    participant Ctrl as ApiControllers
    participant Admin as MerchantAdminService
    participant Store as DemoStore
    Merchant->>UI: 输入 12 位团购券码
    UI->>API: POST /merchant-admin/coupons/verify
    API->>Sec: 携带商家 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 MERCHANT_ADMIN
    Ctrl->>Admin: verifyCoupon(current,code)
    Admin->>Store: couponIndex 查询订单
    Store-->>Admin: 团购订单或空结果
    Admin->>Store: 校验 merchantId、type、status
    alt 有效且属于当前商家
        Admin->>Store: 置 USED 并记录时间线/日志
        Store-->>UI: 返回核销成功
    else 无效、未支付、重复或跨商家
        Store-->>UI: 返回 404/403/409，状态不变
    end
